  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WFP is expanding Cash Based Transfers (CBT) for General Food Assistance (GFA) based on multisectoral and market functionality assessments in 9 targeted refugee settlements (Southwest &#x2013; Kyaka II, Kyagwali, Nakivali, Oruchinga and Rwamwanja; and WestNile &#x2013; Adjumani, Kiryandongo, Rhino and Lobule).</narrative>
  </description>
